{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Install the bundled ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2,"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","level":3,"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Require